  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHANGED_ALLOWED_DROP has the value 0x40</p>
  <p>A user other then the owner (or the owner if the object is no-mod) has added inventory to the prim. This is only possible if enabled with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlAllowInventoryDrop" target="_blank">llAllowInventoryDrop</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

